# DS-0002: no USER instruction. Deliberate: upstream's start.sh must start as
# root to set file capabilities on pihole-FTL, run crond and adjust ownership,
# then it starts FTL as the "pihole" user via capsh. Compensating controls:
# cap_drop ALL with 7 capabilities added back, no-new-privileges, no setuid
# binaries, no package manager (see deploy/docker-compose.yml and
# scripts/smoke-test.sh). Re-review when upstream supports a non-root start.
DS-0002 exp:2027-05-08
